infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Careless script vs production-safe tool
  desc The same 30-line script — four defaults decide whether a teammate can run it
  compares
    - label Careless script
      children
        - label No timeout — waits forever
          desc One stalled upstream freezes the whole script or worker pool
        - label No raise_for_status — a 500 looks fine
          desc You parse the error body and treat it as valid data
        - label API key hard-coded in source
          desc Leaks into the repo, git history, and screen-shares
        - label Global pip install, no venv
          desc Project A's urllib3 pin overwrites project B's
    - label Production-safe tool
      children
        - label timeout=30 — bounded wait
          desc A stuck request fails fast instead of hanging
        - label raise_for_status() — bad status throws
          desc A 4xx/5xx becomes a catchable HTTPError
        - label Key read from os.environ
          desc Secret stays out of source and git history
        - label venv per project + pinned manifest
          desc Isolated and reproducible — no cross-project clash
theme
  palette #f43f5e #10b981
